37	操作系统原理教学大纲-软件工程-2024版	<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span lang="EN-US">1.</span>本课程的课程定位与课程目标</strong></p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;"><strong><span style="mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">课程定位：</span></strong><span style="mso-ascii-font-family: 等线; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: 等线; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">《</span><span style="mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;">操作系统原理</span><span style="mso-ascii-font-family: 等线; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: 等线; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">》是软件工程</span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;">专业的一门必修的</span>专业教育课程<span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt;">，</span><span style="mso-ascii-font-family: 等线; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: 等线; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">在本专业中占据核心且不可替代的地位。它不仅是连接计算机硬件与软件的</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 等线; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">&ldquo;</span><span style="mso-ascii-font-family: 等线; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: 等线; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">神经中枢</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 等线; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">&rdquo;</span><span style="mso-ascii-font-family: 等线; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: 等线; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">，是构建整个计算机知识体系、理解计算机系统工作原理的</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 等线; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">&ldquo;</span><span style="mso-ascii-font-family: 等线; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: 等线; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">基石</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 等线; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">&rdquo;</span><span style="mso-ascii-font-family: 等线; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: 等线; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">，更是培养学生从孤立知识点到系统级认知，进而从系统视角思考和解决问题的关键课程，为解决工业软件领域中的工业数据采集、设备监控系统开发，以及音视频产业中的智能剪辑、高并发传输等复杂工程问题奠定坚实基础。</span></p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;"><span style="mso-ascii-font-family: 等线; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: 等线; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">本课程从资源管理的角度出发，系统讲解计算机操作系统的核心概念与原理，以及在并发、内存、</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 等线; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">I/O</span><span style="mso-ascii-font-family: 等线; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: 等线; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">和文件等方面的管理策略、算法和机制。学生将全面了解操作系统的目标、功能、作用以及整体体系结构，掌握设计和实现的关键技术与机制，培养对操作系统的深刻认知、分析与设计能力。这门课程的价值远不止于知识点本身，它为学生提供了深入理解和驾驭复杂计算机系统的底层思维工具。通过学习，学生将能实现从</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 等线; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">&ldquo;</span><span style="mso-ascii-font-family: 等线; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: 等线; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">单个功能如何实现</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 等线; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">&rdquo;</span><span style="mso-ascii-font-family: 等线; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: 等线; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">到</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 等线; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">&ldquo;</span><span style="mso-ascii-font-family: 等线; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: 等线; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">多个组件如何协同工作</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 等线; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">&rdquo;</span><span style="mso-ascii-font-family: 等线; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: 等线; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">的思维转变，从而能够开发出稳定、高效的软件产品，更好地适应工业软件和音视频产业的需求。</span></p>	56	1759	137	Z20200814	2025-10-15 17:08:01	Z20200814	2026-01-26 10:37:36	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	137	35	f	91,160,162	169,170,123	LOCKED	1	35	2026-09-07 11:25:02.898	\N	\N
