COPY public.em_course_outline_desc (outline_id, origin_id, teach_method, practice_desc, examine_method, goal_finish_desc, reference, is_deleted) FROM stdin;
1	\N	<p style="mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 24.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-outline-level: 2; margin: 6.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">1. </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">教学方式</span></strong></p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;"><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">（<span lang="EN-US">1</span>）运用多媒体课件配合适量板书讲授有关内容，以课件为主，板书起辅导作用。结合具体的算法和经典案例，增强教学的直观性和互动性，使得学生更加容易理解相关理论。充分发挥教学平台的优势，开展线上辅导、讨论。</span></p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;"><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">（<span lang="EN-US">2</span>）推进研究型教学，通过知识的讲授介绍基本方法，培养学生的学科能力，课堂努力再现大师们的问题求解思维过程，引导学生思考，体验思考和求解的乐趣。提出深层问题、扩展问题，鼓励和引导学生开阔视野、主动探索，培养其学习兴趣、创新意识和创新能力。</span></p>\n<p style="mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 24.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-outline-level: 2; margin: 6.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">2. </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">实验教学</span></strong></p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;"><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">教师应<span style="mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">指导</span>学生提前做好预习和准备，课堂可以简要讲解或提示思路和难点。教师在学生实验结束前，现场验收学生设计的系统并给出评定。鼓励学生结合自己的兴趣进行自主扩展实验。</span></p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;"><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">主要仪器设备及其规格型号：</span></p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;"><span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">PC</span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">硬件：<span lang="EN-US">CPU</span>配置不低于<span lang="EN-US">Intel i3</span>，内存不低于<span lang="EN-US">4GB RAM</span>；</span></p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">PC</span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">软件：<span lang="EN-US">Linux</span>操作系统（内核<span lang="EN-US">3.0</span>以上）、<span lang="EN-US">QEMU</span>模拟器、<span lang="EN-US">GCC</span>编译器。</span></p>	<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;" align="left"><span style="font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;">注：</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;" align="left"><span style="font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;">（<span lang="EN-US">1</span>）实验类型分演示、验证、综合、设计、研究创新。</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;" align="left"><span style="font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;">（<span lang="EN-US">2</span>）实验分必选、任选，在备注栏中选填其一。此表所列出的任选项目，可根据实际情况选择开课，但要保证实验课时达到前述&ldquo;一&rdquo;中规定的实践学时数。</span></p>\n<p><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;">（<span lang="EN-US">3</span>）实验教学应进行科学合理分组，每组学生人数要能满足普通高等学校本科专业类教学质量国家标准等相关要求。</span></p>	<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;">本课程是通过检验课程目标的达成度情况来评价学生学习成果的达成度，其考核方式是采用过程性考核与终结性考核相结合的方式，其中：过程性考核环节包括作业与实验；终结性考核为期末闭卷考试。</p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;">各考核环节所占比例为：平时成绩（作业）占<span lang="EN-US">20%</span>、实验占<span lang="EN-US">20%</span>、期末考试占<span lang="EN-US">60%</span>。各考核环节及总评成绩均以百分制计分，即满分为<span lang="EN-US">100</span>分。</p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;">即：</p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 48.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 4.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;">总评成绩 <span lang="EN-US">= </span>平时成绩<span lang="EN-US">*20% + </span>实训成绩<span lang="EN-US">*20% + </span>考试成绩<span lang="EN-US">*60%</span></p>	<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;"><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">课程目标达成情况，为支撑该课程目标的所有考核环节得分总和与这些环节满分总和的比值，其计算公式为：</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center; line-height: 125%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan;" align="center"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 等线; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ligatures: none; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;"><img src="http://24.233.1.135:9000/at-exam/default/4/22ff75204d9630e6424d28383e1148bf.jpg" data-latex="课程目标达成情况=\\frac {总评成绩中相关考核环节平均得分之和} {总评成绩中相关考核环节目标总分}"><br><!--[endif]--></span><!--[endif]--></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center; line-height: 125%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan;" align="center"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 等线; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ligatures: none; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;"><!--[endif]--></span><!--[endif]--></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>	<div>\n<p style="mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 24.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-outline-level: 2; margin: 6.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">1. </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">建议教材</span></strong></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">[1</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;">]<span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;"> </span></span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">汤小丹主编</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;">, </span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">计算机操作系统（慕课版）</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;">, </span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">人民邮电出版社</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;">, <span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">2021.</span></span></p>\n<p style="mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 24.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-outline-level: 2; margin: 6.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">2. </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">教学参考书（包含实验指导、课程思政相关参考书）</span></strong></p>\n<p style="text-indent: -24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 24.0pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;[1</span><span lang="EN-US">]<span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;"> William Stallings</span></span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">编著</span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">操作系统</span><span lang="EN-US">:</span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">精髓与设计原理<span lang="EN-US">(</span>第八版<span lang="EN-US">)</span></span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">电子工业出版社</span><span lang="EN-US">, <span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">2020.</span></span></p>\n<p style="text-indent: -24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 24.0pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;[2] </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">刘美华</span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">翟岩龙编著</span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">操作系统原理教程<span lang="EN-US">(</span>第<span lang="EN-US">4</span>版<span lang="EN-US">)</span></span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">电子工业出版社</span><span lang="EN-US">, <span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">2020.</span></span></p>\n<p style="text-indent: -24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 24.0pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;[3] </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">费翔林</span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">骆斌编著</span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">操作系统教程（第<span lang="EN-US">5</span>版）</span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">高等教育出版社</span><span lang="EN-US">, <span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">2014.</span></span></p>\n<p style="text-indent: -24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 24.0pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;[4] </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">罗宇</span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">邹鹏编著</span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">操作系统（第<span lang="EN-US">4</span>版）</span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">电子工业出版社</span><span lang="EN-US">, <span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">2015.</span></span></p>\n<p style="mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 24.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-outline-level: 2; margin: 6.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">3. </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">网络学习参考资源</span></strong></p>\n<p style="text-indent: -24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 24.0pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;[1] </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">陈渝<span lang="EN-US">, </span>操作系统<span lang="EN-US">(</span>自主模式<span lang="EN-US">)MOOC, </span>清华大学</span></p>\n<p style="text-indent: -22.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 22.0pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 11.0pt; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; http://www.xuetangx.com/courses/course-v1:TsinghuaX+30240243X+sp/about</span></p>\n<p style="text-indent: -24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 24.0pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;[2] </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">骆斌，计算机操作系统<span lang="EN-US">MOOC</span>，南京大学</span></p>\n<p style="text-indent: -24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 24.0pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;http://www.icourse163.or g/course/nju-1001571004</span></p>\n</div>	f
12	\N	<p><strong>1.</strong><strong>教学方式</strong></p>\n<p>理论课教学采用混合式教学方法，课前预习，课内讲解，课后强化。</p>\n<p><strong>2.</strong><strong>实验</strong></p>\n<p>实验课教学采用案例教学，讲练结合，精讲多练，边讲边练，以练为主。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>作业与实验增加以考督学、以考促练环节，引导学生自主编程训练。</p>	<p>注：</p>\n<p>（1）实验类型分演示、验证、综合、设计、研究创新。</p>\n<p>（2）实验要求分必选、任选，在备注栏中选填其一。此表所列出的任选项目，可根据实际情况选择开课，但要保证实验课时达到前述&ldquo;一&rdquo;中规定的实践学时数。</p>\n<p>（3）实验教学应进行科学合理分组，每组学生人数要能满足普通高等学校本科专业类教学质量国家标准等相关要求。</p>	<p>本课程考核由&ldquo;过程性考核&rdquo;、&ldquo;实验考核&rdquo;与&ldquo;期末考核&rdquo;三个环节进行综合给分组成。各项成绩均采用百分制计算。若学生&ldquo;期末考核&rdquo;成绩未达到50分，则过程性考核成绩与实验考核成绩不计入总评成绩。</p>\n<p><strong>总评成绩=过程性考核成绩*30%+实验考核成绩*20%+期末考核成绩*50%。</strong></p>\n<p>（1）过程性考核成绩由平时作业决定，平时作业布置5次。</p>\n<p><img src="data:image/png;base64," data-latex="过程性考核成绩=\\frac {每次作业考核得分之和} {平时作业次数}" /></p>\n<p>（2）实验考核成绩由实验考核决定，实验考核4次。</p>\n<p><img src="data:image/png;base64," data-latex="实验考核成绩=\\frac {每次实验考核得分之和} {实验考核次数}" /></p>\n<p>（3）期末考核成绩由期末考核决定，考核方式为机试，考核时长120分钟。占总评成绩的比例50%。</p>	<p>课程目标达成情况，为总评成绩中支撑该课程目标相关考核环节平均得分之和与对应的总分之和的比值，其计算公式为：</p>\n<p><img src="data:image/png;base64," data-latex="课程目标达成情况=\\frac {总评成绩中相关的考核环节平均得分之和} {总评成绩中相关考核环节目标总分}" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>	<p><strong>1.</strong><strong>建议教材</strong></p>\n<p>[1] C语言程序设计（第4版）[M]. 高等教育出版社，苏小红编著，2023.</p>\n<p><strong>2.</strong><strong>教学</strong><strong>参考书</strong><strong>（包含实验指导、课程思政相关参考书）</strong></p>\n<p>[1] C语言程序设计学习指导（第4版）[M]. 高等教育出版社，苏小红编著，2023.</p>\n<p>[2] C Primer Plus（第6版）中文版[M]. 人民邮电出版社，Stephen Prata著，姜佑译，2020.</p>\n<p>[3] C程序设计教程（第4版）. 清华大学出版社, 谭浩强著, 2022年.</p>\n<p><strong>3.</strong><strong>网络</strong><strong>学习</strong><strong>参考资源</strong></p>\n<p>[1] C语言程序设计精髓 苏小红<br />https://www.icourse163.org/course/0809HIT004B-69005?outVendor=zw_mooc_pclszykctj_</p>\n<p>[2] 浙江大学翁恺老师C语言视频129集</p>\n<p>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1XZ4y1S7e1?spm_id_from=333.788.recommend_more_video.2&amp;vd_source=3853ea78177c8806301fdb46ba1b50d0</p>\n<p>[3] 力扣编程平台 https://leetcode.cn/</p>\n<p>[4] https://www.runoob.com/cprogramming/c-tutorial.html</p>	f
16	1	<p><strong>1.</strong><strong>教学方式</strong></p>\n<p>（1）运用多媒体课件配合适量板书讲授有关内容，以课件为主，板书起辅导作用。结合具体的算法和经典案例，增强教学的直观性和互动性，使得学生更加容易理解相关理论。充分发挥教学平台的优势，开展线上辅导、讨论。</p>\n<p>（2）推进研究型教学，通过知识的讲授介绍基本方法，培养学生的学科能力，课堂努力再现大师们的问题求解思维过程，引导学生思考，体验思考和求解的乐趣。提出深层问题、扩展问题，鼓励和引导学生开阔视野、主动探索，培养其学习兴趣、创新意识和创新能力。</p>\n<p><strong>2.</strong><strong>实验</strong></p>\n<p>...</p>	<p>注：（1）实验/实训：根据课程性质，只选取实验或实训其中一种。</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;（2）...</p>	<p>例：本课程是通过检验课程目标的达成度情况来评价学生学习成果的达成度，其考核方式是采用过程性考核与终结性考核相结合的方式，其中：过程性考核环节包括作业与实验；终结性考核为期末闭卷考试。</p><p>各考核环节所占比例为：平时成绩（作业）占10%、实验占20%、期末考试占70%。各考核环节及总评成绩均以百分制计分，即满分为100分。</p><p>即：</p><p>总评成绩&nbsp;=&nbsp;平时成绩*10%&nbsp;+&nbsp;实训成绩*20%&nbsp;+&nbsp;考试成绩*70%</p>	<p>课程目标达成情况，为总评成绩中支撑该课程目标相关考核环节平均得分之和与对应的总分之和的比值，其计算公式为：</p><p>&nbsp;</p>	<div>\n<div>1.建议教材</div>\n<br />\n<div>[1] ...</div>\n<br />\n<div>[2] ...</div>\n<br />\n<div>2.教学参考书（包含实验指导、课程思政相关参考书）</div>\n<br />\n<div>[1] ...</div>\n<br />\n<div>[2] ...</div>\n<br />\n<div>3.网络学习参考资源</div>\n<br />\n<div>[1]...</div>\n<br />\n<div>[2] ...</div>\n</div>	f
