35	\N	<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 24.1pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 24.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;" align="left"><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt;">1.</span></strong><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin;">教学方式</span></strong></p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;">（<span lang="EN-US">1</span>）运用多媒体课件配合适量板书讲授有关内容，以课件为主，板书起辅导作用。结合具体的算法和经典案例，增强教学的直观性和互动性，使得学生更加容易理解相关理论。充分发挥教学平台的优势，开展线上辅导、讨论。</p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;">（<span lang="EN-US">2</span>）推进研究型教学，通过知识的讲授介绍基本方法，培养学生的学科能力，课堂努力再现大师们的问题求解思维过程，引导学生思考，体验思考和求解的乐趣。提出深层问题、扩展问题，鼓励和引导学生开阔视野、主动探索，培养其学习兴趣、创新意识和创新能力。</p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 24.1pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 24.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;" align="left"><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt;">2.</span></strong><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin;">实验</span></strong></p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;">教师应<span style="mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">指导</span>学生提前做好预习和准备，课堂可以简要讲解或提示思路和难点。教师在学生实验结束前，现场验收学生设计的系统并给出评定。鼓励学生结合自己的兴趣进行自主扩展实验。</p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;">主要仪器设备及其规格型号：<span lang="EN-US">Linux</span>操作系统（内核<span lang="EN-US">3.0</span>以上）、<span lang="EN-US">QEMU</span>模拟器、<span lang="EN-US">GCC</span>编译器</p>	<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; margin: 6.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;"><span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;">注：</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; margin: 6.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;"><span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;">（<span lang="EN-US">1</span>）实验<span lang="EN-US">/</span>实训：根据课程性质，只选取实验或实训其中一种。</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; margin: 6.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;"><span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;">（<span lang="EN-US">2</span>）实验类型分演示、验证、综合、设计、研究创新。实训的类型均为实训。</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; margin: 6.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;"><span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;">（<span lang="EN-US">3</span>）实验<span lang="EN-US">/</span>实训要求分必选、任选。此表所列出的任选项目，可根据实际情况选择开课，但要保证实验<span lang="EN-US">/</span>实训的课时达到前述&ldquo;第一部分&rdquo;中&ldquo;第<span lang="EN-US">6</span>点&rdquo;规定的实践学时数。</span></p>\n<p><span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;">（<span lang="EN-US">4</span>）每组人数一般基础课<span lang="EN-US">1</span>－<span lang="EN-US">2</span>人、专业课<span lang="EN-US">2</span>－<span lang="EN-US">4</span>人、上机课<span lang="EN-US">1</span>人。</span></p>	<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;">本课程是通过检验课程目标的达成度情况来评价学生学习成果的达成度，其考核方式是采用过程性考核与终结性考核相结合的方式，其中：过程性考核环节包括作业与实验；终结性考核为期末闭卷考试。</p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;">各考核环节所占比例为：平时成绩（作业）占<span lang="EN-US">20%</span>、实验占<span lang="EN-US">20%</span>、期末考试占<span lang="EN-US">60%</span>。各考核环节及总评成绩均以百分制计分，即满分为<span lang="EN-US">100</span>分。</p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;">即：</p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 48.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 4.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;">总评成绩 <span lang="EN-US">= </span>平时成绩<span lang="EN-US">*20% + </span>实训成绩<span lang="EN-US">*20% + </span>考试成绩<span lang="EN-US">*60%</span></p>	<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;">课程目标达成情况，为总评成绩中支撑该课程目标相关考核环节平均得分之和与对应的总分之和的比值，其计算公式为：</p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center; line-height: 125%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan;" align="center"><!-- [if gte msEquation 12]><m:oMathPara><m:oMath><span\n  style='mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%;font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:\n  "Cambria Math";mso-hansi-font-family:"Cambria Math";mso-bidi-font-family:\n  "Times New Roman"'><m:r><m:rPr><m:scr m:val="roman"/><m:sty m:val="p"/></m:rPr>课程目标达成情况</m:r></span><span\n  lang=EN-US style='mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%;font-family:\n  "Cambria Math",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:"Times New Roman"'><m:r><m:rPr><m:scr\n     m:val="roman"/><m:sty m:val="p"/></m:rPr>=</m:r></span><m:f><m:fPr><span\n    style='mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:"Cambria Math",serif;\n    mso-ascii-font-family:"Cambria Math";mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-font-family:\n    "Cambria Math";mso-bidi-font-family:"Times New Roman";font-style:italic;\n    mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><m:ctrlPr></m:ctrlPr></span></m:fPr><m:num><span\n    style='mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%;font-family:宋体;\n    mso-ascii-font-family:"Cambria Math";mso-hansi-font-family:"Cambria Math";\n    mso-bidi-font-family:"Times New Roman"'><m:r><m:rPr><m:scr m:val="roman"/><m:sty\n       m:val="p"/></m:rPr>总评成绩中相关考核环节平均得分之和</m:r></span></m:num><m:den><span\n    style='mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%;font-family:宋体;\n    mso-ascii-font-family:"Cambria Math";mso-hansi-font-family:"Cambria Math";\n    mso-bidi-font-family:"Times New Roman"'><m:r><m:rPr><m:scr m:val="roman"/><m:sty\n       m:val="p"/></m:rPr>总评成绩中相关考核环节目标总分</m:r></span></m:den></m:f></m:oMath></m:oMathPara><![endif]--><!-- [if !msEquation]--><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 等线; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ligatures: none; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;"><!-- [if gte vml 1]><v:shapetype\n id="_x0000_t75" coordsize="21600,21600" o:spt="75" o:preferrelative="t"\n path="m@4@5l@4@11@9@11@9@5xe" filled="f" stroked="f">\n <v:stroke joinstyle="miter"/>\n <v:formulas>\n  <v:f eqn="if lineDrawn pixelLineWidth 0"/>\n  <v:f eqn="sum @0 1 0"/>\n  <v:f eqn="sum 0 0 @1"/>\n  <v:f eqn="prod @2 1 2"/>\n  <v:f eqn="prod @3 21600 pixelWidth"/>\n  <v:f eqn="prod @3 21600 pixelHeight"/>\n  <v:f eqn="sum @0 0 1"/>\n  <v:f eqn="prod @6 1 2"/>\n  <v:f eqn="prod @7 21600 pixelWidth"/>\n  <v:f eqn="sum @8 21600 0"/>\n  <v:f eqn="prod @7 21600 pixelHeight"/>\n  <v:f eqn="sum @10 21600 0"/>\n </v:formulas>\n <v:path o:extrusionok="f" gradientshapeok="t" o:connecttype="rect"/>\n <o:lock v:ext="edit" aspectratio="t"/>\n</v:shapetype><v:shape id="_x0000_i1025" type="#_x0000_t75" style='width:276pt;\n height:32.25pt'>\n <v:imagedata src="file:///C:/Users/Neo/AppData/Local/Temp/msohtmlclip1/01/clip_image001.png"\n  o:title="" chromakey="white"/>\n</v:shape><![endif]--><!-- [if !vml]--><img style="transition: none;" src="data:image/png;base64," width="368" height="43"><!--[endif]--></span><!--[endif]--></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>	<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-para-margin-top: 1.0gd; mso-para-margin-right: .5gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 12.05pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; margin: 12.0pt 5.25pt 6.0pt 0cm;"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;">1.</span></strong><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;">建议教材</span></strong></p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;"><span lang="EN-US">[1] [</span>美<span lang="EN-US">]William Stallings.</span>操作系统：精髓与设计原理<span lang="EN-US">(</span>第八版<span lang="EN-US">),</span>电子工业出版社，<span lang="EN-US">2017.</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-para-margin-top: 1.0gd; mso-para-margin-right: .5gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 12.05pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; margin: 12.0pt 5.25pt 6.0pt 0cm;"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;">2.</span></strong><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;">教学参考书（包含实验指导、课程思政相关参考书）</span></strong></p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;"><span lang="EN-US">[1] Abraham Silberschatz</span>，<span lang="EN-US">Operating System Concepts Tenth Editiob</span>，<span lang="EN-US">John Wiley &amp; Sons, Inc., 2018.</span></p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;"><span lang="EN-US">[2] </span>汤小丹主编，计算机操作系统<span lang="EN-US">(</span>第四版<span lang="EN-US">)</span>，西安电子科技大学出版社，<span lang="EN-US">2014.</span></p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;"><span lang="EN-US">[3] </span>费翔林<span lang="EN-US">,</span>骆斌编著，操作系统教程（第<span lang="EN-US">5</span>版），高等教育出版社，<span lang="EN-US">2014.</span></p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;"><span lang="EN-US">[4] </span>罗宇，邹鹏，操作系统（第<span lang="EN-US">4</span>版），北京，电子工业出版社，<span lang="EN-US">2015.</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-para-margin-top: 1.0gd; mso-para-margin-right: .5gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 12.05pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; margin: 12.0pt 5.25pt 6.0pt 0cm;"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;">3.</span></strong><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;">网络学习参考资源</span></strong></p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;"><span lang="EN-US">[1] </span>陈渝，操作系统<span lang="EN-US"> (</span>自主模式<span lang="EN-US">)MOOC</span>，清华大学，<span lang="EN-US">http://www.xuetangx.com /courses /course-v1: TsinghuaX+30240243X+sp/about</span></p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;"><span lang="EN-US">[2] </span>骆斌<span lang="EN-US">.</span>计算机操作系统<span lang="EN-US">MOOC</span>，南京大学，<span lang="EN-US">http://www.icourse163.org/ course/nju-1001571004<span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp; </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="mso-ascii-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast;"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></span></p>	f
37	35	<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 24.1pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 24.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;" align="left"><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt;">1.</span></strong><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin;">教学方式</span></strong></p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;">（<span lang="EN-US">1</span>）运用多媒体课件配合适量板书讲授有关内容，以课件为主，板书起辅导作用。结合具体的算法和经典案例，增强教学的直观性和互动性，使得学生更加容易理解相关理论。充分发挥教学平台的优势，开展线上辅导、讨论。</p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;">（<span lang="EN-US">2</span>）推进研究型教学，通过知识的讲授介绍基本方法，培养学生的学科能力，课堂努力再现大师们的问题求解思维过程，引导学生思考，体验思考和求解的乐趣。提出深层问题、扩展问题，鼓励和引导学生开阔视野、主动探索，培养其学习兴趣、创新意识和创新能力。</p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 24.1pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 24.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;" align="left"><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt;">2.</span></strong><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin;">实验</span></strong></p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;">教师应<span style="mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">指导</span>学生提前做好预习和准备，课堂可以简要讲解或提示思路和难点。教师在学生实验结束前，现场验收学生设计的系统并给出评定。鼓励学生结合自己的兴趣进行自主扩展实验。</p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;">主要仪器设备及其规格型号：<span lang="EN-US">Linux</span>操作系统（内核<span lang="EN-US">3.0</span>以上）、<span lang="EN-US">QEMU</span>模拟器、<span lang="EN-US">GCC</span>编译器</p>	<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; margin: 6.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;"><span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;">注：（<span lang="EN-US">1</span>）实验<span lang="EN-US">/</span>实训：根据课程性质，只选取实验或实训其中一种。</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 18.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; margin: 6.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;"><span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;">（<span lang="EN-US">2</span>）实验类型分演示、验证、综合、设计、研究创新。实训的类型均为实训。</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 18.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; margin: 6.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;"><span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;">（<span lang="EN-US">3</span>）实验<span lang="EN-US">/</span>实训要求分必选、任选。此表所列出的任选项目，可根据实际情况选择开课，但要保证实验<span lang="EN-US">/</span>实训的课时达到前述&ldquo;第一部分&rdquo;中&ldquo;第<span lang="EN-US">6</span>点&rdquo;规定的实践学时数。</span></p>\n<p><span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;">（<span lang="EN-US">4</span>）每组人数一般基础课<span lang="EN-US">1</span>－<span lang="EN-US">2</span>人、专业课<span lang="EN-US">2</span>－<span lang="EN-US">4</span>人、上机课<span lang="EN-US">1</span>人。</span></p>	<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;"><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">本课程为考试课程，最终成绩为百分制。</span></p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;"><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">本课程注重过程考核，坚持平时考核、实验考核与期末考核相结合的原则。本课程总评成绩由&ldquo;平时成绩&rdquo;、&ldquo;实验成绩&rdquo;与&ldquo;期末成绩&rdquo;三部分构成，各项成绩均采用百分制计算。若学生&ldquo;期末成绩&rdquo;未达到<span lang="EN-US">50</span>分，则平时成绩与实验成绩不计入总评成绩。</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: 20.0pt; margin: 6.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;" align="center"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;">总评成绩 <span lang="EN-US">= </span>平时成绩 </span></strong><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; color: black;">&times; </span></strong><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;">20% + </span></strong><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;">实验成绩 </span></strong><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; color: black;">&times; </span></strong><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;">20% + </span></strong><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;">期末成绩 </span></strong><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; color: black;">&times; 60</span></strong><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;">%</span></strong></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: .5gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-margin-left: 42.0pt; text-indent: -21.0pt; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 21.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; margin: 0cm 5.25pt .0001pt 42.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">l<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;">平时成绩由<span lang="EN-US">5</span>次平时作业决定，按每次平时作业成绩（百分制）的权重加权求和，再转换为百分制，计算公式如下：</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center; text-indent: 21.0pt; line-height: 125%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan;" align="center"><!-- [if gte msEquation 12]><m:oMathPara><m:oMath><span\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%;\n  font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:"DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";mso-hansi-font-family:\n  "DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";mso-bidi-font-family:宋体'><m:r><m:rPr><m:scr m:val="roman"/><m:sty\n     m:val="p"/></m:rPr>平时成绩（百分制）</m:r></span><span lang=EN-US\n  style='font-size:10.0pt;line-height:125%;font-family:"DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";\n  mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体'><m:r><m:rPr><m:scr m:val="roman"/><m:sty\n     m:val="p"/></m:rPr>=</m:r></span><m:f><m:fPr><span style='font-size:10.0pt;\n    mso-ansi-font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";\n    mso-ascii-font-family:"DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;\n    mso-hansi-font-family:"DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\n    font-style:italic;mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><m:ctrlPr></m:ctrlPr></span></m:fPr><m:num><span\n    style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%;\n    font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:"DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";mso-hansi-font-family:\n    "DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";mso-bidi-font-family:宋体'><m:r><m:rPr><m:scr m:val="roman"/><m:sty\n       m:val="p"/></m:rPr>每次平时作业成绩按各自权重的加权求和</m:r></span></m:num><m:den><span\n    style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%;\n    font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:"DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";mso-hansi-font-family:\n    "DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";mso-bidi-font-family:宋体'><m:r><m:rPr><m:scr m:val="roman"/><m:sty\n       m:val="p"/></m:rPr>作业的权重和</m:r></span></m:den></m:f><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:\n  normal'><span style='font-size:10.0pt;line-height:125%;font-family:宋体;\n  mso-ascii-font-family:"DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";mso-hansi-font-family:"DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";\n  mso-bidi-font-family:宋体'><m:r>×</m:r></span></i><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:\n  normal'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;line-height:125%;font-family:\n  "DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体'><m:r>100</m:r></span></i></m:oMath></m:oMathPara><![endif]--><!-- [if !msEquation]--><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 等线; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ligatures: none; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;"><!-- [if gte vml 1]><v:shapetype\n id="_x0000_t75" coordsize="21600,21600" o:spt="75" o:preferrelative="t"\n path="m@4@5l@4@11@9@11@9@5xe" filled="f" stroked="f">\n <v:stroke joinstyle="miter"/>\n <v:formulas>\n  <v:f eqn="if lineDrawn pixelLineWidth 0"/>\n  <v:f eqn="sum @0 1 0"/>\n  <v:f eqn="sum 0 0 @1"/>\n  <v:f eqn="prod @2 1 2"/>\n  <v:f eqn="prod @3 21600 pixelWidth"/>\n  <v:f eqn="prod @3 21600 pixelHeight"/>\n  <v:f eqn="sum