ng="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">翟岩龙编著</span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">操作系统原理教程<span lang="EN-US">(</span>第<span lang="EN-US">4</span>版<span lang="EN-US">)</span></span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">电子工业出版社</span><span lang="EN-US">, <span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">2020.</span></span></p>\n<p style="text-indent: -24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 24.0pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; [3] </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">费翔林</span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">骆斌编著</span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">操作系统教程（第<span lang="EN-US">5</span>版）</span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">高等教育出版社</span><span lang="EN-US">, <span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">2014.</span></span></p>\n<p style="text-indent: -24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 24.0pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; [4] </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">罗宇</span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">邹鹏编著</span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">操作系统（第<span lang="EN-US">4</span>版）</span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">电子工业出版社</span><span lang="EN-US">, <span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">2015.</span></span></p>\n<p style="mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 24.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-outline-level: 2; margin: 6.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">3. </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">网络学习参考资源</span></strong></p>\n<p style="text-indent: -24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 24.0pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; [1] </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">陈渝<span lang="EN-US">, </span>操作系统<span lang="EN-US">(</span>自主模式<span lang="EN-US">)MOOC, </span>清华大学</span></p>\n<p style="text-indent: -22.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 22.0pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 11.0pt; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; http://www.xuetangx.com/courses/course-v1:TsinghuaX+30240243X+sp/about</span></p>\n<p style="text-indent: -24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 24.0pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; [2] </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">骆斌，计算机操作系统<span lang="EN-US">MOOC</span>，南京大学</span></p>\n<p style="text-indent: -24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 24.0pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;http://www.icourse163.or g/course/nju-1001571004</span></p>	f
38	\N	<p><strong>1.</strong><strong>教学方式</strong></p>\n<p class="p"><span style="font-family: 宋体;">运用多媒体课件配合适量板书讲授有关内容，以课件为主，板书起辅导作用。结合具体的算法和经典案例，增强教学的直观性和互动性，使得学生更加容易理解相关理论。充分发挥教学平台的优势，开展线上辅导、讨论。</span></p>\n<p><strong>2.</strong><strong>实验</strong></p>\n<p class="p"><span style="font-family: 宋体;">教师</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">指导</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">学生提前做好预习和准备，课堂可以简要讲解或提示思路和难点。教师在学生实验结束前，现场验收学生设计的系统并给出评定。鼓励学生结合自己的兴趣进行自主扩展实验。</span></p>\n<p class="p"><span style="font-family: 宋体;">主要仪器设备及其规格型号</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">：</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-family: 宋体;">硬件：</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">CPU配置不低于Intel i3，内存不低于4GB RAM；</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="font-family: 宋体;">软件：</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">Linux</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">操作系统（内核</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">3.0以上</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">）、</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">QEMU模拟器、G</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">CC编译器。</span></p>	<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family: 宋体;">注：</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family: 宋体;">（</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">1）实验类型分演示、验证、综合、设计、研究创新。</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family: 宋体;">（</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">2）实验分必选、任选，在备注栏中选填其一。此表所列出的任选项目，可根据实际情况选择开课，但要保证实验课时达到前述&ldquo;一&rdquo;中规定的实践学时数。</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family: 宋体;">（</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">3）实验教学应进行科学合理分组，每组学生人数要能满足普通高等学校本科专业类教学质量国家标准等相关要求。</span></p>	<p class="p"><span style="font-family: 宋体;">本课程</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">为考试课程，最终成绩为百分制</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">。</span></p>\n<p class="p"><span style="font-family: 宋体;">本课程注重过程考核</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">坚持平时考核</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">、</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">实验考核</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">与期末</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">考核</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">相结合的原则。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">本课程</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">总评成绩由</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">&ldquo;平时成绩&rdquo;</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">、</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">&ldquo;</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">实验</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">成绩</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">&rdquo;</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">与</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">&ldquo;</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">期末</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">成绩</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">&rdquo;</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">三部分构成，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">各项成绩均采用百分制计算。若学生</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">&ldquo;期末</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">成绩</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">&rdquo;未达到50分，则</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">平时</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">成绩与实验成绩不计入总评成绩。</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" align="center"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;">总评成绩</span></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;">=</span></strong><strong>&nbsp;<span style="font-family: 宋体;">平时</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;">成绩</span></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong><span style="font-family: Arial;">&times;</span></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;">20</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;">%</span></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;">+</span></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;">实验成绩</span></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong><span style="font-family: Arial;">&times;</span></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;">20</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;">%</span></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;">+</span></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;">期末成绩</span></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong><span style="font-family: Arial;">&times;</span></strong><strong>&nbsp;<span style="font-family: Arial;">60</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;">%</span></strong></span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style="mso-list: Ignore;"><span style="font-family: 东文宋体;">● </span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">平时成绩由</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">5次平时作业决定，按每次平时作业成绩（百分制）的权重加权求和，再转换为百分制，计算公式如下：</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" align="center"><img src="http://24.233.1.135:9000/at-exam/default/94/5ad5a418762ba1e8644249b73eeb184d.jpg" width="465" height="49" data-latex="平时成绩(百分制)=\\frac {每次平时作业按各自权重的加权求和} {作业的权重和}*100"></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family: 宋体;"><span style="font-family: 东文宋体;">● </span>实验成绩由</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">5次实验考核决定，按每次实验成绩（百分制）的权重加权求和，再转换为百分制，计算公式如下：</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" align="center"><img src="http://24.233.1.135:9000/at-exam/default/57/6121eecbd3abc6f7a7f45b9f7f2067f3.jpg" width="462" height="46" data-latex="实验成绩（百分制）=\\frac {每次实验成绩按各自权重的加权求和} {实验的权重和}*100"></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family: 宋体;"><span style="font-family: 东文宋体;">● </span>期末成绩由期末考核决定，考核方式为</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">闭卷笔试（或闭卷机试）</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">，考核时长</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">120分钟。</span></p>	<p class="p"><span style="font-family: 宋体;">课程目标达成情况，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">为</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">支撑该课程目标的所有考核环节得分总和与这些环节满分总和的比值</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">其计算公式为：</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" align="center">&nbsp;<img src="http://24.233.1.135:9000/at-exam/default/139/ffa786b41928479cdf91249c3d1630de.jpg" data-latex="课程目标达成情况=\\frac {总评成绩相关考核环节平均得分之和} {总评成绩中相关考核环节目标总分}"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>	<p><strong>1.</strong><strong>建议教材</strong></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family: 宋体;">[1</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">]</span>&nbsp;<span style="font-family: 宋体;">汤小丹主编</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">, </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">计算机操作系统（慕课版）</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">, </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">人民邮电出版社</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">, </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">2021.</span></p>\n<p><strong>2.</strong><strong>教学</strong><strong>参考书</strong><strong>（包含实验指导、课程思政相关参考书）</strong></p>\n<p class="p"><span style="font-family: 宋体;">[1</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">]</span>&nbsp;<span style="font-family: 宋体;">William Stallings</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">编著</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">, </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">操作系统</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">:</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">精髓与设计原理</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">(第八版)</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">, </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">电子工业出版社</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">, </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">2020</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">.</span></p>\n<p class="p"><span style="font-family: 宋体;">[2] 刘美华</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">, </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">翟岩龙</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">编著</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">, </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">操作系统原理教程</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">(第4版)</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">, </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">电子工业出版社</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">,</span>&nbsp;<span style="font-family: 宋体;">2020.</span></p>\n<p class="p"><span style="font-family: 宋体;">[</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">3</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">] 费翔林</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">, </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">骆斌</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">编著</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">, </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">操作系统教程（第</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">5版）</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">, </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">高等教育出版社</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">, </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">2014.</span></p>\n<p class="p"><span style="font-family: 宋体;">[</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">4</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">] 罗宇</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">, </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">邹鹏</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">编著</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">, </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">操作系统（第</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">4版）</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">, </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">电子工业出版社</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">, </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">2015.</span></p>\n<p><strong>3.</strong><strong>网络</strong><strong>学习</strong><strong>参考资源</strong></p>\n<p class="p"><span style="font-family: 宋体;">[1]</span>&nbsp;<span style="font-family: 宋体;">陈渝</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">, </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">操作系统</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">(自主模式)MOOC</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">, </span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">清华大学</span></p>\n<p class="p"><span style="font-family: 宋体;">http://www.</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">xuetangx</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">.com/courses/course-v1:TsinghuaX+30240243X+sp/about</span></p>\n<p class="p"><span style="font-family: 宋体;">[</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">2</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">]</span>&nbsp;<span style="font-family: 宋体;">骆斌</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">计算机操作系统</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">MOOC，南京大学</span></p>\n<p class="p"><span style="font-family: 宋体;">http://www.</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">icourse163</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">.or</span>&nbsp;<span style="font-family: 宋体;">g/course/nju-1001571004</span></p>	f
40	12	<p><strong>1.</strong><strong>教学方式</strong></p>\n<p>理论课教学采用混合式教学方法，课前预习，课内讲解，课后强化。</p>\n<p><strong>2.</strong><strong>实验</strong></p>\n<p>实验课教学采用案例教学，讲练结合，精讲多练，边讲边练，以练为主。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>作业与实验增加以考督学、以考促练环节，引导学生自主编程训练。</p>	<p>注：</p>\n<p>（1）实验类型分演示、验证、综合、设计、研究创新。</p>\n<p>（2）实验要求分必选、任选，在备注栏中选填其一。此表所列出的任选项目，可根据实际情况选择开课，但要保证实验课时达到前述&ldquo;一&rdquo;中规定的实践学时数。</p>\n<p>（3）实验教学应进行科学合理分组，每组学生人数要能满足普通高等学校本科专业类教学质量国家标准等相关要求。</p>	<p>本课程考核由&ldquo;过程性考核&rdquo;、&ldquo;实验考核&rdquo;与&ldquo;期末考核&rdquo;三个环节进行综合给分组成。各项成绩均采用百分制计算。若学生&ldquo;期末考核&rdquo;成绩未达到50分，则过程性考核成绩与实验考核成绩不计入总评成绩。</p>\n<p><strong>总评成绩=过程性考核成绩*30%+实验考核成绩*20%+期末考核成绩*50%。</strong></p>\n<p>（1）过程性考核成绩由平时作业决定，平时作业布置5次。</p>\n<p><img src="data:image/png;base64," data-latex="过程性考核成绩=\\frac {每次作业考核得分之和} {平时作业次数}" /></p>\n<p>（2）实验考核成绩由实验考核决定，实验考核4次。</p>\n<p><img src="data:image/png;base64," data-latex="实验考核成绩=\\frac {每次实验考核得分之和} {实验考核次数}" /></p>\n<p>（3）期末考核成绩由期末考核决定，考核方式为机试，考核时长120分钟。占总评成绩的比例50%。</p>	<p>课程目标达成情况，为总评成绩中支撑该课程目标相关考核环节平均得分之和与对应的总分之和的比值，其计算公式为：</p>\n<p><img src="data:image/png;base64," data-latex="课程目标达成情况=\\frac {总评成绩中相关的考核环节平均得分之和} {总评成绩中相关考核环节目标总分}" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>	<p><strong>1.</strong><strong>建议教材</strong></p>\n<p>[1] C语言程序设计（第4版）[M]. 高等教育出版社，苏小红编著，2023.</p>\n<p><strong>2.</strong><strong>教学</strong><strong>参考书</strong><strong>（包含实验指导、课程思政相关参考书）</strong></p>\n<p>[1] C语言程序设计学习指导（第4版）[M]. 高等教育出版社，苏小红编著，2023.</p>\n<p>[2] C Primer Plus（第6版）中文版[M]. 人民邮电出版社，Stephen Prata著，姜佑译，2020.</p>\n<p>[3] C程序设计教程（第4版）. 清华大学出版社, 谭浩强著, 2022年.</p>\n<p><strong>3.</strong><strong>网络</strong><strong>学习</strong><strong>参考资源</strong></p>\n<p>[1] C语言程序设计精髓 苏小红<br />https://www.icourse163.org/course/0809HIT004B-69005?outVendor=zw_mooc_pclszykctj_</p>\n<p>[2] 浙江大学翁恺老师C语言视频129集</p>\n<p>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1XZ4y1S7e1?spm_id_from=333.788.recommend_more_video.2&amp;vd_source=3853ea78177c8806301fdb46ba1b50d0</p>\n<p>[3] 力扣编程平台 https://leetcode.cn/</p>\n<p>[4] https://www.runoob.com/cprogramming/c-tutorial.html</p>	f
42	40	<p><strong>1.</strong><strong>教学方式</strong></p>\n<p>理论课教学采用混合式教学方法，课前预习，课内讲解，课后强化。</p>\n<p><strong>2.</strong><strong>实验</strong></p>\n<p>实验课教学采用案例教学，讲练结合，精讲多练，边讲边练，以练为主。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>作业与实验增加以考督学、以考促练环节，引导学生自主编程训练。</p>	<p>注：</p>\n<p>（1）实验类型分演示、验证、综合、设计、研究创新。</p>\n<p>（2）实验要求分必选、任选，在备注栏中选填其一。此表所列出的任选项目，可根据实际情况选择开课，但要保证实验课时达到前述&ldquo;一&rdquo;中规定的实践学时数。</p>\n<p>（3）实验教学应进行科学合理分组，每组学生人数要能满足普通高等学校本科专业类教学质量国家标准等相关要求。</p>	<p>本课程考核由&ldquo;过程性考核&rdquo;、&ldquo;实验考核&rdquo;与&ldquo;期末考核&rdquo;三个环节进行综合给分组成。各项成绩均采用百分制计算。若学生&ldquo;期末考核&rdquo;成绩未达到50分，则过程性考核成绩与实验考核成绩不计入总评成绩。</p>\n<p><strong>总评成绩=过程性考核成绩*30%+实验考核成绩*20%+期末考核成绩*50%。</strong></p>\n<p>（1）过程性考核成绩由平时作业决定，平时作业布置5次。</p>\n<p><img src="data:image/png;base64," data-latex="过程性考核成绩=\\frac {每次作业考核得分之和} {平时作业次数}" /></p>\n<p>（2）实验考核成绩由实验考核决定，实验考核4次。</p>\n<p><img src="data:image/png;base64," data-latex="实验考核成绩=\\frac {每次实验考核得分之和} {实验考核次数}" /></p>\n<p>（3）期末考核成绩由期末考核决定，考核方式为机试，考核时长120分钟。占总评成绩的比例50%。</p>	<p>课程目标达成情况，为总评成绩中支撑该课程目标相关考核环节平均得分之和与对应的总分之和的比值，其计算公式为：</p>\n<p><img src="data:image/png;base64," data-latex="课程目标达成情况=\\frac {总评成绩中相关的考核环节平均得分之和} {总评成绩中相关考核环节目标总分}" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>	<p><strong>1.</strong><strong>建议教材</strong></p>\n<p>[1] C语言程序设计（第4版）[M]. 高等教育出版社，苏小红编著，2023.</p>\n<p><strong>2.</strong><strong>教学</strong><strong>参考书</strong><strong>（包含实验指导、课程思政相关参考书）</strong></p>\n<p>[1] C语言程序设计学习指导（第4版）[M]. 高等教育出版社，苏小红编著，2023.</p>\n<p>[2] C Primer Plus（第6版）中文版[M]. 人民邮电出版社，Stephen Prata著，姜佑译，2020.</p>\n<p>[3] C程序设计教程（第4版）. 清华大学出版社, 谭浩强著, 2022年.</p>\n<p><strong>3.</strong><strong>网络</strong><strong>学习</strong><strong>参考资源</strong></p>\n<p>[1] C语言程序设计精髓 苏小红<br />https://www.icourse163.org/course/0809HIT004B-69005?outVendor=zw_mooc_pclszykctj_</p>\n<p>[2] 浙江大学翁恺老师C语言视频129集</p>\n<p>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1XZ4y1S7e1?spm_id_from=333.788.recommend_more_video.2&amp;vd_source=3853ea78177c8806301fdb46ba1b50d0</p>\n<p>[3] 力扣编程平台 https://leetcode.cn/</p>\n<p>[4] https://www.runoob.com/cprogramming/c-tutorial.html</p>	f
53	46	<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 24.1pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 24.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;" align="left"><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt;">1.</span></strong><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin;">教学方式</span></strong></p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;">（<span lang="EN-US">1</span>）运用多媒体课件配合适量板书讲授有关内容，以课件为主，板书起辅导作用。结合具体的算法和经典案例，增强教学的直观性和互动性，使得学生更加容易理解相关理论。充分发挥教学平台的优势，开展线上辅导、讨论。</p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;">（<span lang="EN-US">2</span>）推进研究型教学，通过知识的讲授介绍基本方法，培养学生的学科能力，课堂努力再现大师们的问题求解思维过程，引导学生思考，体验思考和求解的乐趣。提出深层问题、扩展问题，鼓励和引导学生开阔视野、主动探索，培养其学习兴趣、创新意识和创新能力。</p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 24.1pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 24.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;" align="left"><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt;">2.</span></strong><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin;">实验</span></strong></p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;">教师应<span style="mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">指导</span>学生提前做好预习和准备，课堂可以简要讲解或提示思路和难点。教师在学生实验结束前，现场验收学生设计的系统并给出评定。鼓励学生结合自己的兴趣进行自主扩展实验。</p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;">主要仪器设备及其规格型号：<span lang="EN-US">Linux</span>操作系统（内核<span lang="EN-US">3.0</span>以上）、<span lang="EN-US">QEMU</span>模拟器、<span lang="EN-US">GCC</span>编译器</p>	<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; margin: 6.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;"><span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;">注：（<span lang="EN-US">1</span>）实验<span lang="EN-US">/</span>实训：根据课程性质，只选取实验或实训其中一种。</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 18.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; margin: 6.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;"><span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;">（<span lang="EN-US">2</span>）实验类型分演示、验证、综合、设计、研究创新。实训的类型均为实训。</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 18.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; margin: 6.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;"><span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;">（<span lang="EN-US">3</span>）实验<span lang="EN-US">/</span>实训要求分必选、任选。此表所列出的任选项目，可根据实际情况选择开课，但要保证实验<span lang="EN-US">/</span>实训的课时达到前述&ldquo;第一部分&rdquo;中&ldquo;第<span lang="EN-US">6</span>点&rdquo;规定的实践学时数。</span></p>\n<p><span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;">（<span lang="EN-US">4</span>）每组人数一般基础课<span lang="EN-US">1</span>－<span lang="EN-US">2</span>人、专业课<span lang="EN-US">2</span>－<span lang="EN-US">4</span>人、上机课<span lang="EN-US">1</span>人。</span></p>	<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;"><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">本课程为考试课程，最终成绩为百分制。</span></p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;"><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">本课程注重过程考核，坚持平时考核、实验考核与期末考核相结合的原则。本课程总评成绩由&ldquo;平时成绩&rdquo;、&ldquo;实验成绩&rdquo;与&ldquo;期末成绩&rdquo;三部分构成，各项成绩均采用百分制计算。若学生&ldquo;期末成绩&rdquo;未达到<span lang="EN-US">50</span>分，则平时成绩与实验成绩不计入总评成绩。</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: 20.0pt; margin: 6.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;" align="center"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;">总评成绩 <span lang="EN-US">= </span>平时成绩 </span></strong><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; color: black;">&times; </span></strong><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;">25% + </span></strong><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;">实验成绩 </span></strong><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; color: black;">&times; </span></strong><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;">25% + </span></strong><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;">期末成绩 </span></strong><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; color: black;">&times; 50</span></strong><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;">%</span></strong></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: .5gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-margin-left: 42.0pt; text-indent: -21.0pt; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 21.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; margin: 0cm 5.25pt .0001pt 42.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">l<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;">平时成绩由<span lang="EN-US">5</span>次平时作业决定，按每次平时作业成绩（百分制）的权重加权求和，再转换为百分制，计算公式如下：</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center; text-indent: 21.0pt; line-height: 125%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan;" align="center"><!-- [if gte msEquation 12]><m:oMathPara><m:oMath><span\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%;\n  font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:"DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";mso-hansi-font-family:\n  "DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";mso-bidi-font-family:宋体'><m:r><m:rPr><m:scr m:val="roman"/><m:sty\n     m:val="p"/></m:rPr>平时成绩（百分制）</m:r></span><span lang=EN-US\n  style='font-size:10.0pt;line-height:125%;font-family:"DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";\n  mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体'><m:r><m:rPr><m:scr m:val="roman"/><m:sty\n     m:val="p"/></m:rPr>=</m:r></span><m:f><m:fPr><span style='font-size:10.0pt;\n    mso-ansi-font-size:10.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";\n    mso-ascii-font-family:"DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;\n    mso-hansi-font-family:"DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\n    font-style:italic;mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><m:ctrlPr></m:ctrlPr></span></m:fPr><m:num><span\n    style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%;\n    font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:"DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";mso-hansi-font-family:\n    "DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";mso-bidi-font-family:宋体'><m:r><m:rPr><m:scr m:val="roman"/><m:sty\n       m:val="p"/></m:rPr>每次平时作业成绩按各自权重的加权求和</m:r></span></m:num><m:den><span\n    style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%;\n    font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:"DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";mso-hansi-font-family:\n    "DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";mso-bidi-font-family:宋体'><m:r><m:rPr><m:scr m:val="roman"/><m:sty\n       m:val="p"/></m:rPr>作业的权重和</m:r></span></m:den></m:f><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:\n  normal'><span style='font-size:10.0pt;line-height:125%;font-family:宋体;\n  mso-ascii-font-family:"DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";mso-hansi-font-family:"DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";\n  mso-bidi-font-family:宋体'><m:r>×</m:r></span></i><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:\n  normal'><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;line-height:125%;font-family:\n  "DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体'><m:r>100</m:r></span></i></m:oMath></m:oMathPara><![endif]--><!-- [if !msEquation]--><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 等线; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ligatures: none; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;"><!-- [if gte vml 1]><v:shapetype\n id="_x0000_t75" coordsize="21600,21600" o:spt="75" o:preferrelative="t"\n path="m@4@5l@4@11@9@11@9@5xe" filled="f" stroked="f">\n <v:stroke joinstyle="miter"/>\n <v:formulas>\n  <v:f eqn="if lineDrawn pixelLineWidth 0"/>\n  <v:f eqn="sum @0 1 0"/>\n  <v:f eqn="sum 0 0 @1"/>\n  <v:f eqn="prod @2 1 2"/>\n  <v:f eqn="prod @3 21600 pixelWidth"/>\n  <v:f eqn="prod @3 21600 pixelHeight"/>\n  <v:f eqn="sum @0 0 1"/>\n  <v:f eqn="prod @6 1 2"/>\n  <v:f eqn="prod @7 21600 pixelWidth"/>\n  <v:f eqn="sum @8 21600 0"/>\n  <v:f eqn="prod @7 21600 pixelHeight"/>\n  <v:f eqn="sum @10 21600 0"/>\n </v:formulas>\n <v:path o:extrusionok="f" gradientshapeok="t" o:connecttype="rect"/>\n <o:lock v:ext="edit" aspectratio="t"/>\n</v:shapetype><v:shape id="_x0000_i1025" type="#_x0000_t75" style='width:337.9pt;\n height:33.75pt'>\n <v:imagedata src="file:///C:/Users/Neo/AppData/Local/Temp/msohtmlclip1/01/clip_image001.png"\n  o:title="" chromakey="white"/>\n</v:shape><![endif]--><!-- [if !vml]--><img src="http://24.233.1.135:9000/at-exam/default/194/8f83cf274f6ca1042b5aa6ff5d673f62.jpg" width="451" height="45"><!--[endif]--></span><!--[endif]--></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: .5gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-margin-left: 42.0pt; text-indent: -21.0pt; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 21.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; margin: 0cm 5.25pt .0001pt 42.0pt;"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">l<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;">实验成绩由<span lang="EN-US">5</span>次实验考核决定，按每次实验成绩（百分制）的权重加权求和，再转换为百分制，计算公式如下：</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center; text-indent: 21.0pt; line-height: 125%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan;" align="center"><!-- [if gte msEquation 12]><m:oMathPara><m:oMath><span\n  style='mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%;font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:\n  "DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";mso-hansi-font-family:"DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";\n  mso-bidi-font-family:宋体'><m:r><m:rPr><m:scr m:val="roman"/><m:sty m:val="p"/></m:rPr>实验成绩（百分制）</m:r></span><span\n  lang=EN-US style='mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%;font-family:\n  "DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体'><m:r><m:rPr><m:scr\n     m:val="roman"/><m:sty m:val="p"/></m:rPr>=</m:r></span><m:f><m:fPr><span\n    style='mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:"DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";\n    mso-ascii-font-family:"DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;\n    mso-hansi-font-family:"DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\n    font-style:italic;mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><m:ctrlPr></m:ctrlPr></span></m:fPr><m:num><span\n    style='mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%;font-family:宋体;\n    mso-ascii-font-family:"DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";mso-hansi-font-family:"DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";\n    mso-bidi-font-family:宋体'><m:r><m:rPr><m:scr m:val="roman"/><m:sty m:val="p"/></m:rPr>每次实验成绩按各自权重的加权求和</m:r></span></m:num><m:den><span\n    style='mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%;font-family:宋体;\n    mso-ascii-font-family:"DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";mso-hansi-font-family:"DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";\n    mso-bidi-font-family:宋体'><m:r><m:rPr><m:scr m:val="roman"/><m:sty m:val="p"/></m:rPr>实验的权重和</m:r></span></m:den></m:f><i\n  style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span style='mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;\n  line-height:125%;font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:"DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";\n  mso-hansi-font-family:"DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";mso-bidi-font-family:宋体'><m:r>×</m:r></span></i><i\n  style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span lang=EN-US style='mso-bidi-font-size:\n  10.5pt;line-height:125%;font-family:"DejaVu Math TeX Gyre";mso-fareast-font-family:\n  宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体'><m:r>100</m:r></span></i></m:oMath></m:oMathPara><![endif]--><!-- [if !msEquation]--><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 等线; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ligatures: none; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;"><!-- [if gte vml 1]><v:shape\n id="_x0000_i1025" type="#_x0000_t75" style='width:304.15pt;height:32.25pt'>\n <v:imagedata src="file:///C:/Users/Neo/AppData/Local/Temp/msohtmlclip1/01/clip_image003.png"\n  o:title="" chromakey="white"/>\n</v:shape><![endif]--><!-- [if !vml]--><img src="http://24.233.1.135:9000/at-exam/default/87/8bc398921212e76934df9d8d2d6e9d2a.jpg" width="406" height="43"><!--[endif]--></span><!--[endif]--></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: .5gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-margin-left: 42.0pt; text-align: left; text-indent: -21.0pt; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 21.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none; margin: 0cm 5.25pt .0001pt 42.0pt;" align="left"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list: Ignore;">l<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black;">期末成绩由期末考核决定，考核方式为闭卷笔试（或闭卷机试），考核时长<span lang="EN-US">120</span>分钟。</span></p>	<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;">课程目标达成情况，为总评成绩中支撑该课程目标相关考核环节平均得分之和与对应的总分之和的比值，其计算公式为：</p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center; line-height: 125%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan;" align="center"><!-- [if gte msEquation 12]><m:oMathPara><m:oMath><span\n  style='mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%;font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:\n  "Cambria Math";mso-hansi-font-family:"Cambria Math";mso-bidi-font-family:\n  "Times New Roman"'><m:r><m:rPr><m:scr m:val="roman"/><m:sty m:val="p"/></m:rPr>课程目标达成情况</m:r></span><span\n  lang=EN-US style='mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%;font-family:\n  "Cambria Math",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:"Times New Roman"'><m:r><m:rPr><m:scr\n     m:val="roman"/><m:sty m:val="p"/></m:rPr>=</m:r></span><m:f><m:fPr><span\n    style='mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:"Cambria Math",serif;\n    mso-ascii-font-family:"Cambria Math";mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-font-family:\n    "Cambria Math";mso-bidi-font-family:"Times New Roman";font-style:italic;\n    mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><m:ctrlPr></m:ctrlPr></span></m:fPr><m:num><span\n    style='mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%;font-family:宋体;\n    mso-ascii-font-family:"Cambria Math";mso-hansi-font-family:"Cambria Math";\n    mso-bidi-font-family:"Times New Roman"'><m:r><m:rPr><m:scr m:val="roman"/><m:sty\n       m:val="p"/></m:rPr>总评成绩中相关考核环节平均得分之和</m:r></span></m:num><m:den><span\n    style='mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%;font-family:宋体;\n    mso-ascii-font-family:"Cambria Math";mso-hansi-font-family:"Cambria Math";\n    mso-bidi-font-family:"Times New Roman"'><m:r><m:rPr><m:scr m:val="roman"/><m:sty\n       m:val="p"/></m:rPr>总评成绩中相关考核环节目标总分</m:r></span></m:den></m:f></m:oMath></m:oMathPara><![endif]--><!-- [if !msEquation]--><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 等线; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ligatures: none; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;"><!-- [if gte vml 1]><v:shapetype\n id="_x0000_t75" coordsize="21600,21600" o:spt="75" o:preferrelative="t"\n path="m@4@5l@4@11@9@11@9@5xe" filled="f" stroked="f">\n <v:stroke joinstyle="miter"/>\n <v:formulas>\n  <v:f eqn="if lineDrawn pixelLineWidth 0"/>\n  <v:f eqn="sum @0 1 0"/>\n  <v:f eqn="sum 0 0 @1"/>\n  <v:f eqn="prod @2 1 2"/>\n  <v:f eqn="prod @3 21600 pixelWidth"/>\n  <v:f eqn="prod @3 21600 pixelHeight"/>\n  <v:f eqn="sum @0 0 1"/>\n  <v:f eqn="prod @6 1 2"/>\n  <v:f eqn="prod @7 21600 pixelWidth"/>\n  <v:f eqn="sum @8 21600 0"/>\n  <v:f eqn="prod @7 21600 pixelHeight"/>\n  <v:f eqn="sum @10 21600 0"/>\n </v:formulas>\n <v:path o:extrusionok="f" gradientshapeok="t" o:connecttype="rect"/>\n <o:lock v:ext="edit" aspectratio="t"/>\n</v:shapetype><v:shape id="_x0000_i1025" type="#_x0000_t75" style='width:276pt;\n height:32.25pt'>\n <v:imagedata src="file:///C:/Users/Neo/AppData/Local/Temp/msohtmlclip1/01/clip_image001.png"\n  o:title="" chromakey="white"/>\n</v:shape><![endif]--><!-- [if !vml]--><img style="transition: none;" src="data:image/png;base64," width="368" height="43"><!--[endif]--></span><!--[endif]--></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>	<p style="mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 24.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-outline-level: 2; margin: 6.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">1. </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">建议教材</span></strong></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">[1</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;">]<span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;"> </span></span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">汤小丹主编</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;">, </span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">计算机操作系统（慕课版）</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;">, </span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">人民邮电出版社</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;">, <span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">2021.</span></span></p>\n<p style="mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 24.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-outline-level: 2; margin: 6.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">2. </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">教学参考书（包含实验指导、课程思政相关参考书）</span></strong></p>\n<p style="text-indent: -24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 24.0pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;[1</span><span lang="EN-US">]<span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;"> William Stallings</span></span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">编著</span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">操作系统：精髓与设计原理<span lang="EN-US">(</span>第八版<span lang="EN-US">)</span></span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">电子工业出版社</span><span lang="EN-US">, <span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">2020.</span></span></p>\n<p style="text-indent: -24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 24.0pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; [2] </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">刘美华</span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">翟岩龙编著</span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">操作系统原理教程<span lang="EN-US">(</span>第<span lang="EN-US">4</span>版<span lang="EN-US">)</span></span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">电子工业出版社</span><span lang="EN-US">, <span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">2020.</span></span></p>\n<p style="text-indent: -24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 24.0pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; [3] </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">费翔林</span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">骆斌编著</span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">操作系统教程（第<span lang="EN-US">5</span>版）</span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">高等教育出版社</span><span lang="EN-US">, <span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">2014.</span></span></p>\n<p style="text-indent: -24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 24.0pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; [4] </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">罗宇</span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">邹鹏编著</span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">操作系统（第<span lang="EN-US">4</span>版）</span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">电子工业出版社</span><span lang="EN-US">, <span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">2015.</span></span></p>\n<p style="mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 24.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-outline-level: 2; margin: 6.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">3. </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">网络学习参考资源</span></strong></p>\n<p style="text-indent: -24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 24.0pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; [1] </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">陈渝<span lang="EN-US">, </span>操作系统<span lang="EN-US">(</span>自主模式<span lang="EN-US">)MOOC, </span>清华大学</span></p>\n<p style="text-indent: -22.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 22.0pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 11.0pt; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; http://www.xuetangx.com/courses/course-v1:TsinghuaX+30240243X+sp/about</span></p>\n<p style="text-indent: -24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 24.0pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; [2] </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">骆斌，计算机操作系统<span lang="EN-US">MOOC</span>，南京大学</span></p>\n<p style="text-indent: -24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 24.0pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;http://www.icourse163.or g/course/nju-1001571004</span></p>	f
46	37	<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 24.1pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 24.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;" align="left"><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt;">1.</span></strong><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin;">教学方式</span></strong></p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;">（<span lang="EN-US">1</span>）运用多媒体课件配合适量板书讲授有关内容，以课件为主，板书起辅导作用。结合具体的算法和经典案例，增强教学的直观性和互动性，使得学生更加容易理解相关理论。充分发挥教学平台的优势，开展线上辅导、讨论。</p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;">（<span lang="EN-US">2</span>）推进研究型教学，通过知识的讲授介绍基本方法，培养学生的学科能力，课堂努力再现大师们的问题求解思维过程，引导学生思考，体验思考和求解的乐趣。提出深层问题、扩展问题，鼓励和引导学生开阔视野、主动探索，培养其学习兴趣、创新意识和创新能力。</p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 24.1pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 24.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;" align="left"><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt;">2.</span></strong><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin;">实验</span></strong></p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;">教师应<span style="mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">指导</span>学生提前做好预习和准备，课堂可以简要讲解或提示思路和难点。教师在学生实验结束前，现场验收学生设计的系统并给出评定。鼓励学生结合自己的兴趣进行自主扩展实验。</p>\n<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;">主要仪器设备及其规格型号：<span lang="EN-US">Linux</span>操作系统（内核<span lang="EN-US">3.0</span>以上）、<span lang="EN-US">QEMU</span>模拟器、<span lang="EN-US">GCC</span>编译器</p>	<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; margin: 6.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;"><span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;">注：（<span lang="EN-US">1</span>）实验<span lang="EN-US">/</span>实训：根据课程性质，只选取实验或实训其中一种。</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 18.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; margin: 6.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;"><span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;">（<span lang="EN-US">2</span>）实验类型分演示、验证、综合、设计、研究创新。实训的类型均为实训。</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 18.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; margin: 6.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;"><span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;">（<span lang="EN-US">3</span>）实验<span lang="EN-US">/</span>实训要求分必选、任选。此表所列出的任选项目，可根据实际情况选择开课，但要保证实验<span lang="EN-US">/</span>实训的课时达到前述&ldquo;第一部分&rdquo;中&ldquo;第<span lang="EN-US">6</span>点&rdquo;规定的实践学时数。</span></p>\n<p><span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;">（<span lang="EN-US">4</span>）每组人数一般基础课<span lang="EN-US">1</span>－<span lang="EN-US">2</span>人、专业课<span lang="EN-US">2</span>－<span lang="EN-US">4</span>人、上机课<span lang="EN-US">1</span>人。</span></p>	<p class="p"><span style="font-family: 宋体;">本课程为考试课程，最终成绩为百分制。</span></p>\n<p class="p" align="justify"><span style="font-family: 宋体;">本课程注重过程考核，坚持平时考核、实验考核与期末考核相结合的原则。本课程总评成绩由</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">&ldquo;</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">平时成绩</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">&rdquo;</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">、</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">&ldquo;</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">实验成绩</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">&rdquo;</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">与</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">&ldquo;</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">期末成绩</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">&rdquo;</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">三部分构成，各项成绩均采用百分制计算。若学生</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">&ldquo;</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">期末成绩</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">&rdquo;</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">未达到</span> <span style="font-family: 宋体;">50 分，则平时成绩与实验成绩不计入总评成绩。</span></p>\n<p class="p" align="center"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;">总评成绩</span> <span style="font-family: 宋体;">= 平时成绩 &times; 25% + 实验成绩 &times; 25% + 期末成绩 &times; 50%</span></strong></p>\n<p class="p" align="justify"><span style="font-family: 宋体;">平时成绩由</span> <span style="font-family: 宋体;">5 次平时作业决定，按每次平时作业成绩（百分制）的权重加权求和，再转换为百分制；实验成绩由 5 次实验考核决定，按每次实验成绩（百分制）的权重加权求和，再转换为百分制；期末成绩由期末考核决定，考核方式为闭卷笔试（或闭卷机试），考核时长 120 分钟。</span></p>	<p style="margin: 0cm; text-indent: 24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;">课程目标达成情况，为总评成绩中支撑该课程目标相关考核环节平均得分之和与对应的总分之和的比值，其计算公式为：</p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center; line-height: 125%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan;" align="center"><!-- [if gte msEquation 12]><m:oMathPara><m:oMath><span\n  style='mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%;font-family:宋体;mso-ascii-font-family:\n  "Cambria Math";mso-hansi-font-family:"Cambria Math";mso-bidi-font-family:\n  "Times New Roman"'><m:r><m:rPr><m:scr m:val="roman"/><m:sty m:val="p"/></m:rPr>课程目标达成情况</m:r></span><span\n  lang=EN-US style='mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%;font-family:\n  "Cambria Math",serif;mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:"Times New Roman"'><m:r><m:rPr><m:scr\n     m:val="roman"/><m:sty m:val="p"/></m:rPr>=</m:r></span><m:f><m:fPr><span\n    style='mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;font-family:"Cambria Math",serif;\n    mso-ascii-font-family:"Cambria Math";mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;mso-hansi-font-family:\n    "Cambria Math";mso-bidi-font-family:"Times New Roman";font-style:italic;\n    mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><m:ctrlPr></m:ctrlPr></span></m:fPr><m:num><span\n    style='mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%;font-family:宋体;\n    mso-ascii-font-family:"Cambria Math";mso-hansi-font-family:"Cambria Math";\n    mso-bidi-font-family:"Times New Roman"'><m:r><m:rPr><m:scr m:val="roman"/><m:sty\n       m:val="p"/></m:rPr>总评成绩中相关考核环节平均得分之和</m:r></span></m:num><m:den><span\n    style='mso-bidi-font-size:10.5pt;line-height:125%;font-family:宋体;\n    mso-ascii-font-family:"Cambria Math";mso-hansi-font-family:"Cambria Math";\n    mso-bidi-font-family:"Times New Roman"'><m:r><m:rPr><m:scr m:val="roman"/><m:sty\n       m:val="p"/></m:rPr>总评成绩中相关考核环节目标总分</m:r></span></m:den></m:f></m:oMath></m:oMathPara><![endif]--><!-- [if !msEquation]--><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 等线; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ligatures: none; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;"><!-- [if gte vml 1]><v:shapetype\n id="_x0000_t75" coordsize="21600,21600" o:spt="75" o:preferrelative="t"\n path="m@4@5l@4@11@9@11@9@5xe" filled="f" stroked="f">\n <v:stroke joinstyle="miter"/>\n <v:formulas>\n  <v:f eqn="if lineDrawn pixelLineWidth 0"/>\n  <v:f eqn="sum @0 1 0"/>\n  <v:f eqn="sum 0 0 @1"/>\n  <v:f eqn="prod @2 1 2"/>\n  <v:f eqn="prod @3 21600 pixelWidth"/>\n  <v:f eqn="prod @3 21600 pixelHeight"/>\n  <v:f eqn="sum @0 0 1"/>\n  <v:f eqn="prod @6 1 2"/>\n  <v:f eqn="prod @7 21600 pixelWidth"/>\n  <v:f eqn="sum @8 21600 0"/>\n  <v:f eqn="prod @7 21600 pixelHeight"/>\n  <v:f eqn="sum @10 21600 0"/>\n </v:formulas>\n <v:path o:extrusionok="f" gradientshapeok="t" o:connecttype="rect"/>\n <o:lock v:ext="edit" aspectratio="t"/>\n</v:shapetype><v:shape id="_x0000_i1025" type="#_x0000_t75" style='width:276pt;\n height:32.25pt'>\n <v:imagedata src="file:///C:/Users/Neo/AppData/Local/Temp/msohtmlclip1/01/clip_image001.png"\n  o:title="" chromakey="white"/>\n</v:shape><![endif]--><!-- [if !vml]--><img style="transition: none;" src="data:image/png;base64," width="368" height="43"><!--[endif]--></span><!--[endif]--></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>	<p style="mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 24.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-outline-level: 2; margin: 6.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">1. </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">建议教材</span></strong></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">[1</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;">]<span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;"> </span></span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">汤小丹主编</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;">, </span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">计算机操作系统（慕课版）</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;">, </span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">人民邮电出版社</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体;">, <span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">2021.</span></span></p>\n<p style="mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 24.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-outline-level: 2; margin: 6.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">2. </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">教学参考书（包含实验指导、课程思政相关参考书）</span></strong></p>\n<p style="text-indent: -24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 24.0pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;[1</span><span lang="EN-US">]<span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;"> William Stallings</span></span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">编著</span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">操作系统：精髓与设计原理<span lang="EN-US">(</span>第八版<span lang="EN-US">)</span></span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">电子工业出版社</span><span lang="EN-US">, <span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">2020.</span></span></p>\n<p style="text-indent: -24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 24.0pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; [2] </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">刘美华</span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">翟岩龙编著</span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">操作系统原理教程<span lang="EN-US">(</span>第<span lang="EN-US">4</span>版<span lang="EN-US">)</span></span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">电子工业出版社</span><span lang="EN-US">, <span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">2020.</span></span></p>\n<p style="text-indent: -24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 24.0pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; [3] </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">费翔林</span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">骆斌编著</span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">操作系统教程（第<span lang="EN-US">5</span>版）</span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">高等教育出版社</span><span lang="EN-US">, <span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">2014.</span></span></p>\n<p style="text-indent: -24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 24.0pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; [4] </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">罗宇</span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">邹鹏编著</span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">操作系统（第<span lang="EN-US">4</span>版）</span><span lang="EN-US">, </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">电子工业出版社</span><span lang="EN-US">, <span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">2015.</span></span></p>\n<p style="mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 24.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-outline-level: 2; margin: 6.0pt 0cm 6.0pt 0cm;"><strong style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">3. </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">网络学习参考资源</span></strong></p>\n<p style="text-indent: -24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 24.0pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; [1] </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">陈渝<span lang="EN-US">, </span>操作系统<span lang="EN-US">(</span>自主模式<span lang="EN-US">)MOOC, </span>清华大学</span></p>\n<p style="text-indent: -22.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 22.0pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 11.0pt; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; http://www.xuetangx.com/courses/course-v1:TsinghuaX+30240243X+sp/about</span></p>\n<p style="text-indent: -24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 24.0pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; [2] </span><span style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">骆斌，计算机操作系统<span lang="EN-US">MOOC</span>，南京大学</span></p>\n<p style="text-indent: -24.0pt; mso-char-indent-count: -2.0; line-height: 20.0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 24.0pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;http://www.icourse163.or g/course/nju-1001571004</span></p>	f
