1457696874470445056	71	<p>斐波那契数（通常用F(n)表示）形成的序列称为斐波那契数列。该数列由0和1开始，后面的每一项数字都是前面两项数字的和。也就是：</p>\n<p><img src="at-user-service/download/subject/resource?resource=/subject/3e3c2236-df83-4709-b115-298b38646601/d21.png" /></p>\n<p><img src="at-user-service/download/subject/resource?resource=/subject/bbe86698-781f-477c-9de1-a49574606b4a/d22.png" /></p>\n<p>将下面的代码补充完整(n &lt;= 30)（用递归实现）</p>\n<p><img src="at-user-service/download/subject/resource?resource=/subject/0242aae7-7a93-4c3f-aae7-50eed03e747a/d23.png" /></p>	<p>/* 注意：答案不唯一，参考答案如下： */</p>\n<p>int fib(int n) {</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;if (n == 0) return 0; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;/* +2分 */</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;if (n == 1) return 1; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;/* +2分 */</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;return fib(n - 1) + fib(n - 2); &nbsp;/* +6分 */</p>\n<p>}</p>	10.00	<p>/* 注意：答案不唯一，参考答案如下： */</p>\n<p>int fib(int n) {</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;if (n == 0) return 0; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;/* +2分 */</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;if (n == 1) return 1; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;/* +2分 */</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;return fib(n - 1) + fib(n - 2); &nbsp;/* +6分 */</p>\n<p>}</p>	2	anonymousUser	2026-01-05 11:26:58	anonymousUser	2026-01-05 11:26:57	f	16	\N	\N	1	\N	\N	0	\N
1457696874571108352	71	<p>输入一个字符串数组s以及长度n，统计每一个小写英文字母的出现次数。(n &lt;= 500且输入的元素只包含小写英文字母)。 实现下面的函数功能。</p>\n<p><img src="at-user-service/download/subject/resource?resource=/subject/3f8e3221-14dd-4663-911d-d206e1d0816b/d3.png" /></p>	<p>/* 注意：答案不唯一，参考答案如下： */</p>\n<p>void Count(char s[], int n, int hash[]) {</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;for (int i = 0; i &lt; n; i++) {&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;/* +4分 */</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;hash[s[i] - 'a']++;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;/* +6分 */</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;}</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;return ;</p>\n<p>}</p>	10.00	<p>/* 注意：答案不唯一，参考答案如下： */</p>\n<p>void Count(char s[], int n, int hash[]) {</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;for (int i = 0; i &lt; n; i++) {&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;/* +4分 */</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;hash[s[i] - 'a']++;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;/* +6分 */</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;}</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;return ;</p>\n<p>}</p>	2	anonymousUser	2026-01-05 11:26:58	anonymousUser	2026-01-05 11:26:57	f	17	\N	\N	1	\N	\N	0	\N
